How to train Model 

Step 1: Open the Files Sidebar
On the very left edge of your screen, look at the column of white icons on the dark sidebar.
Click the Folder icon 📁 (it's the 6th icon down, right below the key icon).
this will open the Files panel on the left side of your workspace.

Step 2: Navigate to the Trained Model
Once the Files panel opens, double-click to open these folders in order:
Open runs
Open detect
Open train (or train2 if you ran it more than once)
Open weights

Step 3: Find best.pt
Inside the weights folder, you will see two files:
last.pt
best.pt 👈 This is your trained AI model!
